{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>元祖級「東張女神」梁麗翹（Nicole）自2017年與圈外男友Nic結婚並誕下一對仔女後，生活一直相當富貴。適逢前日（11月14日）是Nicole的42歲生日，她在社交平台開心分享了一段收生日禮物的短片。原來她的百億闊太閨密、1997年四料港姐冠軍翁嘉穗（Virginia）聯同幾位好友，為她精心策劃了一場生日驚喜，更送上名貴的Tiffany手鏈，𠱁得壽星女當場感動到眼濕濕！</p><figure><img alt=\"梁麗翹係元祖級「東張女神」。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198691699606425600465038.jpeg/gk1WnQzofzdpXkOeTRZTLiQQE6Yl7-gZ70vKz-9Lys8\"/><figcaption>梁麗翹係元祖級「東張女神」。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁麗翹老公身份好神秘。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198695239783682048485320.png/q01s09PqZ8X_mSnrVrX9k2aZwUMTt_9FydC97cnQve0\"/><figcaption>梁麗翹老公身份好神秘。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁麗翹老公身份好神秘。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198695237266968576947138.png/m9nC_9zPP-NHGgPU199hzAJkc7RBHIdXizwNV4s8DVc\"/><figcaption>梁麗翹老公身份好神秘。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"育有兩個小朋友，保養得唔錯。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198691633764241408814703.jpeg/0w3l5a9T8gHnRFfpjPQ2WmQ5_4fdHTZZ0HUg9NB1IPQ\"/><figcaption>育有兩個小朋友，保養得唔錯。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"雖然工作量不多，但就非常富貴！（IG/@nicoleleung1114）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918157001303789568580342.jpeg/0XqFYvQ0LhkgPWLdvBz1MXB0_PzliJUUyY4SE8mOEhM\"/><figcaption>雖然工作量不多，但就非常富貴！（IG/@nicoleleung1114）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《東張西望》女神之一的梁麗翹（Nicole）打入上流圈！（IG/@nicoleleung1114）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918156827126927360681095.jpeg/wcjdGKgJaxWeMP-XKjmWJ6iH7lxm8qSa_9-BIf_fgSE\"/><figcaption>《東張西望》女神之一的梁麗翹（Nicole）打入上流圈！（IG/@nicoleleung1114）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同甘比合照！（IG/@nicoleleung1114）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918159143494225920867201.jpeg/egqvgVc7L19ThsaVgT_PB0NByaeCyyel8u4hhfLuIYU\"/><figcaption>同甘比合照！（IG/@nicoleleung1114）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"上流圈！（IG/@nicoleleung1114）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241002/918157153041125376823647.jpeg/dHlUDsXSDMxv5yNkNGIp7a53oT389bbwfU92T31Pdk8\"/><figcaption>上流圈！（IG/@nicoleleung1114）</figcaption></figure><p>閨密夾計送Tiffany藍盒　感動眼濕濕</p><p>從Nicole分享的片段可見，身穿香檳金吊帶長裙的她，在貴賓房內收到一個標誌性的「Tiffany藍色盒子」。當她打開禮物發現是一條名貴手鏈時，難掩激動之情。Nicole感動到眼濕濕，更要用雙手狂撥幫自己冷靜情緒，連聲說「多謝」。</p><p>身旁的閨密翁嘉穗亦盛裝打扮出席，穿上一身藍綠色絲絨超短連身褲，配以性感黑絲及高踭鞋，盡顯百億闊太的貴氣與好身材。兩人隨後開心擁抱合照，場面相當溫馨。</p><figure><img alt=\"梁麗翹生日，翁嘉穗穿黑絲騷美腿。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198692601155293184581039.jpeg/q1ZfVI94HQnril1nXQTFwhBvHT4rcyz9tqyd_rasnf4\"/><figcaption>梁麗翹生日，翁嘉穗穿黑絲騷美腿。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁麗翹42歲生日。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198692604431175680637980.jpeg/kTceDNyLQGKaMzCPO7qf708jdmxatNkVoIONFKCDjRQ\"/><figcaption>梁麗翹42歲生日。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"收禮物一刻。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693697462472704152834.jpeg/BAQuWzbonfNgCR5DpmBKX3MVCaATeKcTyjWDLMo1gyw\"/><figcaption>收禮物一刻。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"真係感動到眼有淚光。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693333225050112425786.png/_ksr3KDRGF7i2APkNwUbIb8dIZrUKSiaA8dAgQPHQIE\"/><figcaption>真係感動到眼有淚光。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"真係感動到眼有淚光。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693331031298048853469.png/F5r5TItTg1p13zl-NPuIxxLL7uSAEB9VDpAJmA6QCZg\"/><figcaption>真係感動到眼有淚光。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"真係感動到眼有淚光。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693337553833984107968.png/LvhobRPmnSIiOCK-EpGWJG_2uCVr0gg_AsOEogLDhKI\"/><figcaption>真係感動到眼有淚光。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"真係感動到眼有淚光。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693335464939520472185.png/fXCCXXuyF2rMMLdG5M4phwnZ701eYonO7XZKVu12SlY\"/><figcaption>真係感動到眼有淚光。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"收到禮物一刻難掩喜悅。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693968867627008945236.jpeg/3lHmUcF19wVA8gwoNwzSsV-kPs9ARWdJc7Xe_nO13v4\"/><figcaption>收到禮物一刻難掩喜悅。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"收到禮物一刻難掩喜悅。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693966317359104064871.jpeg/lP847BwM2o5sDbV5oQB2PzPjUsgFOqmNVi0ggFYtIIA\"/><figcaption>收到禮物一刻難掩喜悅。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"友人一齊送厚禮，梁麗翹喜出望外。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693971321425920859710.jpeg/yhiSHjvgPU-louDsT5pXE6B-CmIMk3dXs7D7B7Ow-wc\"/><figcaption>友人一齊送厚禮，梁麗翹喜出望外。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"友人一齊送厚禮，梁麗翹喜出望外。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693973955579904580374.jpeg/SYouCiJwo50kov5joH3tdVh8lvxpGn7FoveO3aL3jt0\"/><figcaption>友人一齊送厚禮，梁麗翹喜出望外。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"友情難能可貴。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693972034588672015427.jpeg/lyzrtaL3KLsTV72lq0Xa_IeAUV6rQLnhWG34L1ht-C8\"/><figcaption>友情難能可貴。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"友情難能可貴。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693969656156160142789.jpeg/hPBQipMUyab2IUq0GoBCj7GPS_lnfNcmz8hA08_IQNM\"/><figcaption>友情難能可貴。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"友情難能可貴。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693972411944960273651.jpeg/Cog-RHuwAkNkVY8lG1KNDKLfHpR0aBeHo4GRAaOBkQE\"/><figcaption>友情難能可貴。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁麗翹被要求打扮得靚啲，原來生日有驚喜。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693975163539456519734.jpeg/1uPlXLbDIWnQSS37-TTRRcjCmGRvXx5aCMfJIwjHySM\"/><figcaption>梁麗翹被要求打扮得靚啲，原來生日有驚喜。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁麗翹被要求打扮得靚啲，原來生日有驚喜。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693960030097408714589.jpeg/fcx9ywcmdsUiVsQNW38EJ2v_UNJzkQ-xFZOCchWTgnI\"/><figcaption>梁麗翹被要求打扮得靚啲，原來生日有驚喜。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁麗翹被要求打扮得靚啲，原來生日有驚喜。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693962915909632135642.jpeg/lvftBMHZHe2grbZvwDdDU2GFSYvVljJo2E1MrNhNTKw\"/><figcaption>梁麗翹被要求打扮得靚啲，原來生日有驚喜。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁麗翹被要求打扮得靚啲，原來生日有驚喜。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693965428428800093165.jpeg/CwCffFjJnUdXzUSm1cy2_xpCMHEpoGOmasjxI2rI8SM\"/><figcaption>梁麗翹被要求打扮得靚啲，原來生日有驚喜。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗盛裝打扮。(IG@kashuivirginia)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693976774283264912470.jpeg/Yn6A9duBaZw_bd8hT5GqLrEh0kuU5JRmglQvHYJULx0\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗盛裝打扮。(IG@kashuivirginia)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗盛裝打扮。(IG@kashuivirginia)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693964413145088601285.jpeg/8cdPNMzAM-blE685ee278VHX8u2a7B21gGLtroBi7a4\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗盛裝打扮。(IG@kashuivirginia)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗盛裝打扮。(IG@kashuivirginia)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693967261208576780942.jpeg/jkx6DHkanuJKbZx7GAM1f3fpj7cH_Z9wgYJXk4GCV5M\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗盛裝打扮。(IG@kashuivirginia)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗盛裝打扮。(IG@kashuivirginia)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693969786310656308496.jpeg/t6vfqVfIPp0vVKFHbC2zfrRVYQ-E8z3umAruZJgK7mQ\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗盛裝打扮。(IG@kashuivirginia)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"再有朋友跟她慶祝，收到多個蛋糕。(IG@kashuivirginia)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198698314648915968329406.png/PDQEi4Ar5Wpr-WnmhusEK6t11Mjy8GVZShe80EoXvNA\"/><figcaption>再有朋友跟她慶祝，收到多個蛋糕。(IG@kashuivirginia)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"再有朋友跟她慶祝，收到多個蛋糕。(IG@kashuivirginia)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198698311834406912074681.png/NA4KdiIsBcrNq5HCdD9cfkplyEXPnSzdEwTYJxME2Cc\"/><figcaption>再有朋友跟她慶祝，收到多個蛋糕。(IG@kashuivirginia)</figcaption></figure><p>撰長文感激無機心友誼：你對我似親姊妹</p><p>Nicole事後在IG撰寫長文，感激翁嘉穗及好友Zach、Ivan和Jimmy送上的甜蜜驚喜。她冧爆寫道：「誰不喜歡一點閃耀？尤其是在Tiffany藍色的盒子裏？」她更透露原來一切早有預謀：「Virginia一直告訴我要穿得漂亮，現在我知道為什麼了：你們想讓我準備好拍照，哈哈。我通常會提前估到驚喜，但你們這次真的騙到我了！」</p><p>對於這份珍貴的友誼，Nicole感觸良多，特別點名感激翁嘉穗：「在我們這個年紀，沒有機心（agendas）的友誼是我最珍惜的。Virginia，你對我來說就像一個姊妹。我很感激我們能分享想法和感受，並信任彼此。希望我們的友誼在生活的所有變化中都能保持堅固。」最後她直呼自己「感到被愛着」，看來這個42歲生日的確過得相當難忘！</p><figure><img alt=\"撰長文感激一班好朋友。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693498665046016947835.png/6Wv_iMcceFI-GG5wFRXNRKpvVYS51gJR7k071u5NO9Y\"/><figcaption>撰長文感激一班好朋友。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"友誼永固。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198693598581755904326408.jpeg/NvHE-hjZzgvPov3U6QCokB4HwDVt6e7V7GsPpexrD6U\"/><figcaption>友誼永固。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生完小朋友，身材依然keep得咁好。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198691459499429888269308.jpeg/Loc5aibIo-MhFCr8vX0CG8u80aph3vYJBeHffwXh338\"/><figcaption>生完小朋友，身材依然keep得咁好。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生完小朋友，身材依然keep得咁好。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198691461798039552071359.jpeg/9WijKWK4WGOt3908gRVxqCHnDaIZVGbn6CjIgugoyII\"/><figcaption>生完小朋友，身材依然keep得咁好。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生完小朋友，身材依然keep得咁好。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198691463970820096790143.jpeg/erP9bdpjGA0_3pqA_a1bRkShSK3UUnuNXOTtL1zk7S8\"/><figcaption>生完小朋友，身材依然keep得咁好。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生完小朋友，身材依然keep得咁好。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198691457188237312501726.jpeg/R2paB3L6O_uxmgsogMqIHyDPp2r1TugYvLPm4Lyz5uA\"/><figcaption>生完小朋友，身材依然keep得咁好。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Fit爆身形。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198690792999358464146738.jpeg/jC6C7fEdybcM12rTm_u6ZeGTzC3dEXjvygdkk8oHZJM\"/><figcaption>Fit爆身形。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Fit爆身形。(IG:nicoleleung1114)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198690790398758912794850.jpeg/0M2Z4YjSmWgKKDDdpzY-JIFeOBW4pNLlN7jEsje4xLI\"/><figcaption>Fit爆身形。(IG:nicoleleung1114)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T00:29:33.667711+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2078,"images":40,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T00:00:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T03:04:51.973674+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T00:22:53.736674+00:00","content_hash":"57932c36da66db5d0764165072b5a3e4e39942bf9d8fd52bd0b0752e9dad8ef7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}